#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy apps/web/.env.example to apps/web/.env.local for local frontend dev
# 2. Copy apps/api/.env.example to apps/api/.dev.vars for local Cloudflare Worker dev
# 3. For production:
#    - Frontend: Set Variables in Cloudflare Dashboard (Workers & Pages > oheyra-web > Settings > Variables)
#    - API: Set Variables in Cloudflare Dashboard (Workers & Pages > oheyra-api > Settings > Variables)
#    - Database: Apply migrations to Supabase via SQL Editor or Supabase CLI
#
# ==============================================================

